{'symbol': 'LHX', 'date': '2020-12-21 09:00:00', 'title': 'US NAVY AWARDS L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES $496 MILLION NEXT GENERATION JAMMER LOW BAND TACTICAL JAMMING SYSTEM CONTRACT', 'text': "SALT LAKE CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE U.S. NAVY HAS AWARDED L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE:LHX) A FIVE-YEAR, $496 MILLION CONTRACT TO DELIVER PROTOTYPE TACTICAL JAMMING PODS DESIGNED TO EXTEND U.S. AIR SUPERIORITY. THE NEXT GENERATION JAMMER LOW BAND (NGJ-LB) IS A HIGH-POWERED, HIGH-CAPACITY AIRBORNE ELECTRONIC WARFARE (EW) SYSTEM. L3HARRIS' SINGLE-POD SOLUTION ENABLES EXTENDED STAND-OFF JAMMING CAPABILITY, COVERS A BROAD SPECTRUM AND PROCESSES AN INCREASED NUMBER OF THREATS. THE SYSTEM OPERATES SE"}